WEBVTT

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:06.060
I believe we all wish to continue walking forward with the...

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.230
...knowledge gained from Tonan High
engraved into our hearts.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:17.210
Teachers, parents, we are truly indebted to you for guiding us through these three years.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.150
Thank you. Class 3-F representative, Aihara Kotoko.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.740
Likewise, Ikezawa Kinnosuke.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.070
You wouldn’t think that they’re from Class-F, right?

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.970
I wouldn’t expect anything less from the Irie of Class-F, Aihara-san.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.100
Well done, Kotoko. I expected no less.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.730
Irie-senpai!

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.490
Irie-senpai, please give me your second button!

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.730
No, please give it to me!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:50.740
I’m sorry, but my heart is already
set on someone.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.810
Here, Kotoko!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.750
Please take this. This is just right for you.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.700
I’m so happy.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.600
Irie-kun, thank you.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:12.380
Then, let’s take a commemorative picture to celebrate the beginning of our wonderful journey.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.470
Kotoko, I’ll never let you go.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.920
Irie-kun...

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:33.310
A dream?

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.820
And I was thinking that it was too good to be true.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.440
No! I can’t let it end as a mere dream!

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.570
The dream I had was a good one too.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:49.380
At the very least, I’m going to show Irie-kun my good side on this final day.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.470
Onii-chan, Kotoko-chan. Are you guys ready?

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.040
Today is a very important day!

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.190
You mustn’t have a single speck of dust on your uniform.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:32.520
After all, you’re the representing graduate for the formal address.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.330
And Kotoko-chan is the class delegate.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:36.060
Yes!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.550
That’s enough.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:41.700
Onii-chan, you mustn’t give your second button to any other girl.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.260
Give it to Kotoko-chan, okay?

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.440
Give it a rest. I’m going now.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:49.150
Onii-chan! I want to take a picture in front of the house to commemorate your graduation!

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.840
Wait, Irie-kun!

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:54.500
It’s the last day after all,
so let’s go together.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.030
Your mother said that she’ll be bringing the camcorder there later.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.090
Again? Sheesh.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.100
Time sure flies, doesn’t it?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.240
I can’t believe high school is ending today.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:10.090
But, out of the three years,
this year was the most fun.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:14.570
Out of the 18 years I have lived,
this year was the most difficult.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:23.180
I <i>will</i> show him how great I am today!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.660
It’s Irie.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.020
It’s Irie-kun.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.210
It seems that he didn’t take the Tokyo University exam.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.050
I heard that he’ll be attending
the university here.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.760
Aihara of Class-F will be with him?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.080
Hey, Irie!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.620
You’re the subject of all the gossip, eh?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.120
Morning, Watanabe-kun.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.660
Hey, Kotoko-chan. Morning.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:49.190
You got accepted into your college of choice, didn’t you? Congratulations.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.190
You’re amazing.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.180
Thanks.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.220
By the way, the teachers are
infuriated with you.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:57.080
For skipping the Tokyo University exam.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.890
Oh, really?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.650
It’s all my fault.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.630
Despite how much Irie-kun denies it
and says that it was his will...

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:11.580
...I’m sure if I didn’t have those stomach pains back then...

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.920
...Irie-kun’s life would have been different.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.100
...having you around has made life more interesting and exciting.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.510
I was thinking that it may be a good idea to just go with the escalator system.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.590
I mustn’t grin.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.950
I’m supposed to be repenting.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:24.220
Kotoko!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:24.840
Kin-chan!
Kotoko!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.710
Irie will be attending
the same university as you?

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.840
That’s right. With Kotoko.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.110
What did you say?!

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:34.590
You can choose to go to Tokyo University or wherever, you freak!

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.910
Why here of all places?!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:38.610
You can join us too.
It’s an escalator system after all.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:43.430
Oh, you failed to even make it
onto the escalator, eh?

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.610
You should be worrying about the future of the two of you.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.780
Damn you!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:50.320
I decided I’m going to start working to make Kotoko happy!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.950
I’m not a mama’s boy like you!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:53.540
Are you listening?!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.880
Stop, Kin-chan.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:58.610
Don’t you dare look down on me, Irie!

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.190
Sheesh, have you calmed down a bit?

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.680
We’re the representatives for Class-F after all.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.360
Yep, you can count on me!

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.260
I’ll save you if you look like you’re gonna fall from the stage.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.840
Don’t say unpleasant things like that.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.340
Ah, Jinko, morning!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:18.410
Whatever. I have the greatest plan in the world for today.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.300
Entering next: Class-F.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.970
Hey, Kotoko, your arms are moving together with your legs.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.050
Oh, mama!
Kotoko-chan, good luck!

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.270
Oh, no. She looks really nervous.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.990
Hey, keep it together!
You’re the class representative.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.030
This is the very last day that Kin-chan will be a student.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:43.550
That’s why we chose you two as our representatives.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.800
Don’t drop our certificates all over the place, okay?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.040
It’s no use telling me that.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:53.080
I’ve never ever been on the morning assembly stage before in my life.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.790
Furthermore, I’ll be climbing the stairs right in front of Irie-kun.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:02.190
Formal address, graduate representative, Irie Naoki.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.480
Yes.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.860
Irie-kun.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.860
On this fine day, the peach blossoms have matured, while the days are getting warmer.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.500
I am honored to have so many present today...

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.510
...to make this ceremony so grand and magnificent...

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:19.490
My feelings are going back to that day three years ago.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:23.000
It’s the same feeling as the day I first saw Irie-kun.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:25.430
The day I fell in love with Irie at first sight.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:30.210
My unrequited feelings started right here.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:33.180
Many things sure have happened since then.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.100
Even though I couldn’t make
our feelings mutual,

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.520
I made many important memories of my adolescence.

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:41.940
I’m so glad I fell in love with Irie-kun.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:47.200
Class-F representatives,
Aihara Kotoko and Ikezawa Kinnosuke.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.400
Yes!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.710
Gosh, what’s that about?

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.850
Hey, Kotoko!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:53.020
Huh, what?

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.200
Aihara Kotoko!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:54.910
Yes!

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:59.780
Oh, no!

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.920
I mustn’t make any more mistakes!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.430
Kin-san! Kotoko-san!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.110
Just leave it to us!

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.180
Stop it!

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.010
Is this okay, Irie?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.010
How idiotic.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.270
Come on, Kotoko. We should go arm-in-arm.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.140
Don’t be stupid! I won’t do such a thing.

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:22.060
The time has come.
Irie-kun is watching too. Good luck, me!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:26.150
Ooh, we’re going to be ascending those steps.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.280
This is like...

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.270
That’s it!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.780
It’s like a wedding ceremony, isn’t it?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.710
Forgive me, Kin-chan.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.930
I failed to notice your love for so long.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.320
You’re so silly. Don’t cry.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:44.300
I love you, Kotoko.

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.300
Kin-chan.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.300
Kotoko.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.630
Kin-chan.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.170
Kotoko.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.020
Ikezawa Kinnosuke.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.790
Oh, a minister.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:57.640
Do you swear to love Aihara Kotoko, in sickness and in health...

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.810
...until death do you part?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.060
I swear, of course!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.070
You swear to what?

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:14.090
Will you stop it, Kin-chan?
It’s embarrassing!

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:17.360
Sorry. I was just suddenly
imagining our futures.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.630
However, Irie Naoki!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:24.330
Don’t you rest easy just because you’ll be attending the same college as Kotoko.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.870
I’ll soon become a skilled chef...

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.400
...and marry Kotoko!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.710
I just wanted to tell everyone here.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.710
No objections, right?

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.330
I object! Onii-chan, say something quick!

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.150
Face up to him and say that you’ll never let that happen!

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.510
Oh, mama!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.000
“Onii-chan” refers to you, doesn’t it?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.980
Irie sure has it rough.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.480
Kin-chan, you idiot!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.100
I don’t know you any more!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:04.430
Man, that Kin-chan. It’s because he said something so strange.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.080
Ah, thanks.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.240
You idiot!

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.880
But, it wasn’t my fault.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.890
Well done, Kotoko. I expected no less.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:20.110
Kotoko-chan, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to fly into a fit there.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.060
Not at all.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:25.550
Everyone was already expecting something like that since it’s you after all.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.730
It’s better to have a unique, lively graduation ceremony anyway.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.210
So, don’t let it get you down so much.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.590
How nice!

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.220
This is what a graduation ceremony should be like!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.210
I’m so jealous! Why aren’t we...?

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:49.060
Gah, that Onii-chan really drives me crazy! Why, on such a wonderful day like this...?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.790
There, there, it’s only a small matter.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.370
Ah, Kotoko!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:57.260
Senpai, can I have your second button please?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.080
It’s a first year girl!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:02.270
She’s badgering him for his second button!
What an unbelievable girl!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.550
This is good, isn’t it?
She got rejected, Kotoko!

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:10.590
It’s as though I’m watching a video of myself from a year ago.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:11.630
Poor girl.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:14.570
Oh, really? That’s awful!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.610
If only that girl would accept my button instead.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.200
Here comes another one.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.780
She’s a second year student.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.270
He’s sure popular with the girls.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.490
Irie-san, can we take a picture together?

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:27.620
No, thanks.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.000
Just one will do!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.120
Don’t be so persistent.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.380
Keep it up, Onii-chan!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:36.000
All right. You’re up next, Kotoko-chan. Go.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:40.870
You have to show how far ahead you are of the other girls.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.850
Ask for his second button, okay?

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:45.890
And don’t forget to ask to take a picture together too, okay?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:49.280
Ah, how nice! This atmosphere.
This situation.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:52.270
This is adolescence, isn’t it?
You have my permission to kiss him.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.650
Uh, Oba-san...

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.660
Good luck, Kotoko. Come on, hurry!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.030
No way, she can’t be serious.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.330
What is it?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.280
Well...

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.200
Don’t tell me that you’re going to ask for my second button?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.450
Correct!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.670
I not giving it.

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.960
Then, what about a picture...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.000
I’m not taking one.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.790
Please take this.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.630
Kotoko, I’ll never let go of you.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.090
Oba-sama!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.640
What a horrible thing to do!

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.560
Wait, Onii-chan! What’s with that attitude?

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.340
I can’t believe you didn’t respond to Kotoko’s courageous feelings!

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.060
And you call yourself a man?!

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:42.800
Fine, I just have to take a picture, right?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.930
Really? Thanks!

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.510
Just one will do, okay?

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.670
Obviously, sheesh!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:57.980
Okay, I’m going to shoot. Kotoko-chan, Onii-chan, smile.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.840
Say cheese!

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.470
Hello!

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:02.460
Kin-chan!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.680
Hey! Why did you show up?!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.760
After all the trouble I went through to get a wonderful two-shot of them!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:13.070
Hah! You’re a hundred years too early to take a two-shot of Kotoko without me.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.310
Wait, Irie-kun!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.270
I posed for the one photo, didn’t I?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.360
No way...

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.580
High school life, Class-F life, goodbye!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.510
Those years in Class-F were pretty long.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.320
College is finally coming.

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:37.170
Come on, Kotoko. How long are you going to stay depressed?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.390
But... my graduation... my dreams...

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:44.420
They all ended without a single one coming true.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.600
That’s something which happens all the time anyway.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:49.090
More importantly, there’s going to be a party later!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.670
But, it kinda worries me that Kin-chan is the organizer.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.430
Let’s eat lots of yummy food and party away!

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.410
Sorry to keep you all.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.580
It’s so cold!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.960
What’s wrong.
Why does everyone look so down?

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.450
This is the worst spot ever.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.810
Toilet, toilet...

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.090
It smells, doesn’t it?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.340
Well, let’s start with a toast.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.550
How thoughtful of you, Sensei.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.550
It may be a bit presumptuous of me, but as the organizer...

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.810
...I, Ikezawa Kinnosuke, will do the honors. Cheers everyone!

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.520
It’s really freezing.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.990
Irie-kun?!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:40.140
What the?! Why is Irie here?!

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.090
What’s wrong, Irie?

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.570
Eh? The guys from Class-F...

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.330
Don’t tell me Class-A is celebrating here too?

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:48.430
Unfortunately, we are.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.910
Oh, no. Why with Class-F?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.630
Of all people.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:56.240
What’s wrong with you people?! What’s wrong with Class-F?!

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:59.900
But, being able to see each other again here...

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:03.890
...perhaps my day isn’t over just yet.

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:09.270
This a a token of my appreciation to my excellent students. It’s my treat today.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.150
Please enjoy yourselves as much as possible!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.290
What’s with this strange difference in level?

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.910
I don’t like this atmosphere,
for some odd reason.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:27.500
It’s like they’re separating us by class.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.910
Say Irie-kun, is it true that you’re going to our college?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.870
Yes.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.860
Eh? I was so sure you’d be attending Tokyo University.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:45.010
I should have gone with the escalator too in that case.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.340
What the heck is that?

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.640
Irie-kun...

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:49.810
Irie-kun.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.520
What’s going on? I can’t see.

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.170
Kin-chan!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.840
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:05.190
Welcome to Kinnosuke on-stage tonight!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.950
Please listen to my song, “Kotoko, my love.”

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:11.540
A one, two, three, four...

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.860
<i>I love Kotoko.</i>

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:19.300
<i>I’m so grateful that I was able to meet her.</i>

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.500
<i>Kotoko loves me too.</i>

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.700
<i>That’s why we’re happy.</i>

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:33.650
<i>We met during spring when sakura petals fall.</i>

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:36.960
<i>Is God playing a trick on me?</i>

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:39.040
<i>I fell in love with Kotoko at first sight.</i>

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.040
Could this be...?

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.260
That their feelings are mutual?

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.770
Stop it!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.560
No need to get embarrassed, Kotoko.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.410
There’s still a lot of my shouts of love to come.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:52.750
What? There’s more?

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.760
The meal is going to get spoiled.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.300
What did you say?!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.380
Irie, you bastard!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.510
Who could it be at a time like this?

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.010
Oh, boss!

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:05.910
<i>Ah, Kinnosuke.</i>

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:06.590
Yes?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:09.850
<i>Sorry for calling you at such a time, but can you please come to the shop?</i>

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:13.520
<i>It seems that all the other workers caught a cold at the same time.</i>

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.790
Understood! I’ll be there immediately!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.490
I’m sorry, Kotoko, but your father said that he’s relying on me.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:26.660
I’m going now for the sake
of our bright future.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.820
Ciao.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.100
What was that?

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.640
Really...

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.510
That student earlier;

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.210
I heard he won’t be attending college, but is instead seeking employment?

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:40.710
And what’s wrong with that?!

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:43.200
No, nothing at all.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:47.550
He’ll merely be joining society earlier!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.860
It’s no reason to treat him like an idiot!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.220
That’s right!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.720
Really, all of you.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:58.340
Also, there seems to be a student in Class-F...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.230
...who’s nothing but a hindrance to our best student.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:06.130
Rumor has it that it was her fault that he’s not going to be attending Tokyo University.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.080
Sensei.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.120
It’s not her fault.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:13.650
But, Irie...

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:19.320
To have people say that I made such a mistake for that idiot would be the greater humiliation.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:22.700
Hey, what’s with calling me an idiot?!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.210
It’s the truth, isn’t it?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.020
That may be true...

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.790
...but intelligence isn’t everything to being human, right?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.420
What’s most important is the heart!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:36.990
It’d still be more convincing if those words came from an intelligent person.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:40.520
Why you...! You’re always like this!

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:43.240
You cold-hearted bully!

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:46.180
But you’re in love with that cold-hearted bully, aren’t you?

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:52.670
That reminds me, didn’t Aihara-san give a love letter to Irie-kun?

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.750
That’s right. I heard he didn’t accept it though.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.380
She sure tries hard.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.420
She has a pointless amount of courage, I guess.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:01.780
Pointless, eh?

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:02.820
That’s for certain.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.350
Pointless?!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:11.170
The feelings I carried these three years... This is too cruel!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:16.920
That’s right. I know your feelings all too well.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:21.510
If you’re going to that extent, then I have an idea too.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.090
What is it?

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.660
It’s...

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:26.970
...this!

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.410
Who’s that girl?

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:32.680
How adorable!

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.850
Why do you have that?!

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:37.390
Everyone, would you believe it, but...

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:42.500
...this is a picture of the Irie-kun you see here when he was young!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.150
Let me see!

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.010
What is this?

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.370
Why you...!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.530
I received another one from your mother.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:53.750
Come!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.790
Kotoko.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.340
Doesn’t this seem really bad?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.630
Stop it! Let go of me!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.360
Ow, what are you doing?!

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:07.980
What are you planning to do?

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.610
You sure pull no punches.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:14.940
I won’t be scared even if you threaten me.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:20.190
You turned my feelings into a laughing matter in front of everyone.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.930
So, I was just returning the favor!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.830
I’ve had enough!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.180
I’m going to stop loving you!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.390
Can you do something like that?

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:35.890
I can!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:38.750
I know your character so well
that it disgusts me!

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:43.300
I’ll reset all of my unrequited feelings together with the graduation!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:48.260
So, you’re going to forget me.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.390
That’s right!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.020
I’m going to forget you and attend college...

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.390
Then, go ahead and try

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.500
Serves you right.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.930
A kiss?

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:29.310
Irie-kun...

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:33.530
...kissed me!

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:11.080
Irie-kun kissed me!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.350
What are you doing?
We’re going to be late.

00:23:13.350 --> 00:23:15.250
You really are a blockhead.

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:17.540
So, the situation is still the same.

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:21.100
But starting today, I’m a college student!
And we’re also attending the same college too!

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:22.080
Oh, Matsumoto.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.500
Who’s that?! Who’s that woman?!

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:26.760
Come on, Irie-kun...

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:28.590
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:30.800
The campus life I’ve longed for!?

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.790
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
